            <note corresp="#d344-f1" n="17" xml:id="d344-f1-content">
                <p>Evidently refers to telegrams of February 23 and 25 from the clerk in charge of
                    the Legation at Monrovia, <hi rendition="#italic">supra.</hi></p>
